  "representativeCastDefIDOverride": "castDef_MarcusHammerick",
  "shortDescription": "The former [[DM.Factions[faction_RemembranceCell],Remembrance Cell]] primary research facility on <i>Argondale</i> contains the complete documentation archive of the Armageddon project. Dr. Tilsaye requires direct physical access to the archive terminal to extract the records, as remote access has been deliberately disabled by security protocols.\n\nThe download process cannot be accelerated without risking data corruption and will require approximately forty minutes of sustained connection time. The local Remembrance Cell forces under Joanna McEvedy's command will respond immediately once their sensors detect activity at the facility location.\n\nPrimary objective is to defend the facility perimeter and prevent enemy forces from reaching Dr. Tilsaye until the archive extraction is complete. Expected opposition includes heavy assault forces with orders to destroy the archive and eliminate Dr. Tilsaye before she can secure the evidence.\n\nThe archive contains comprehensive documentation of the Armageddon project from initial conception through current assembly status. If this evidence is lost or destroyed, there will be no independent verification of the project's existence or capabilities beyond witness testimony.",
  "longDescription": "We hold the line while Tilsaye pulls the archive. If Joanna's people reach her before the download finishes, there is no record. Just her word against a zealot with an army.",
